==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|seed|ling|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|botany}} A young [[plant]] grown from [[seed]]
# Any young plant, especially
## one grown in a [[nursery]] for transplanting
## a tree smaller than a [[sapling]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|chit}}

